WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.694 line:84%
Hindi consonants are grouped into classes. The first group is the ka group.

00:00:06.694 --> 00:00:08.903 line:84%
Ka, kha, ga, gha, nga.

00:00:09.903 --> 00:00:11.670 line:84%
Cha, chha, ja, jha, nya.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:16.272 line:84%
Now say the ka group and the cha group once each.
